{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>綜合外媒11月10日報道，一架載有6名外國公民的私人飛機在菲律賓南部棉蘭老島墜毀，暫未確認機組人員和乘客是否遇難。</p><p>據路透社報道，菲律賓南達沃省（Davao del Sur）迪戈斯市（Digos）的災害機構官員Jomar Calledo周二表示，當前救援行動正在進行中，還無法確定乘客和機組人員是否遇難。</p><figure><img alt=\"圖為一名男子舉著菲律賓國旗（Getty）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230412/722759514868158464821365.jpeg/NA5XujHTlVA-LU8WyHsPq47WCJfP0_ZDZsKzoWbCs6E\"/><figcaption>圖為一名男子舉著菲律賓國旗（Getty）</figcaption></figure><p>據菲律賓每日詢問報（Inquirer.net）報道，有關當局稱這一事故發生在當地時間上午8時左右。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.077108+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:17:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:55:14.658968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:00.529560+00:00","content_hash":"cad83206599c799bb126e5a457a733a407c63287683b9761a28ad4f548bcd379","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}